      "D": "The inventory position of $28 million at 4.2× turnover indicates strong asset management and provides a substantial liquidation buffer. In a downturn, Meridian can convert inventory to cash to service debt obligations. Recommend approving the facility with a borrowing base tied to eligible inventory."
